        <text>Cloudy, with a high near 83. West wind around 5 mph. </text>
        <text>Showers. The rain could be heavy at times.  Low around 66. West wind 5 to 15 mph becoming north in the evening. Winds could gust as high as 20 mph.  Chance of precipitation is 100%. New precipitation amounts between three quarters and one inch possible. </text>
        <text>Showers, mainly before 11am. The rain could be heavy at times.  High near 72. Southwest wind 10 to 15 mph, with gusts as high as 25 mph.  Chance of precipitation is 100%. New precipitation amounts between a quarter and half of an inch possible. </text>
        <text>Showers likely, mainly after 11pm.  Cloudy, with a low around 62. Southwest wind around 5 mph.  Chance of precipitation is 70%. New precipitation amounts of less than a tenth of an inch possible. </text>
